WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,490 --> 00:00:06,090
Han Jiangxue's loyalty increased to one hundred, absolute loyalty

2
00:00:06,090 --> 00:00:10,340
After just a few words, my loyalty is full.

3
00:00:10,340 --> 00:00:14,870
I will never suppress myself again in the future

4
00:00:14,870 --> 00:00:19,290
I will treat fighting as a talent given to me by God

5
00:00:19,290 --> 00:00:22,420
What I said last night was mostly true.

6
00:00:22,420 --> 00:00:25,580
If she suppresses her talent, sooner or later something will go wrong

7
00:00:25,580 --> 00:00:29,980
But the rest of it is hidden behind selfish motives, I want her to follow me more steadily.

8
00:00:29,980 --> 00:00:34,100
I just didn't expect that every sentence would be perfect in one step.

9
00:00:34,100 --> 00:00:43,430
Loyalty ninety-six

10
00:00:43,430 --> 00:00:46,430
Yo, Qingqing’s loyalty has also increased so much.
